{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "User Manual Good Practices"}, {"type": "position", "content": 8}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about user manuals. "}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Designs a user manual that fulfills both the IT solution needs and the client requirements.  Understand how to write a good user manual."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.   Exchanges simple information on the operating systems, server operating systems and relevant information related with the user manual."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Adjectives ending in \u2013ed and \u2013ing"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Adjectives </span> help us describe the characteristics of subjects."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you want to make an interesting manual, first you need to define the type of users."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You will make your users feel satisfied by providing solutions or recommendations about it."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Adjectives </span> are words that describe the subject and its characteristics. In English,  you can create adjectives finishing in <span class=\"strong\"> \u2013ing </span> or <span class=\"strong\"> \u2013ed </span> with some words. Although they may look similar they have different meanings. <br/><br/> <strong>-ed Adjectives:</strong><br/> This type of adjectives describes emotions and how people feel about something."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example:<br/> He was very <span class=\"strong\"> bored </span> in the class.<br/> I'm <span class=\"strong\"> confused </span>about the new software. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<strong>-ing Adjectives:</strong><br/> This type of adjectives describes the thing that generates the emotion."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example:<br/> The class was very <span class=\"strong\"> boring</span>. <br/> The new software is <span class=\"strong\"> confusing</span>.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at some examples of adjectives in the table below."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Adjectives</div>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":10,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><strong>-ing</strong> </div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><strong>-ed</strong> </div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Confusing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Confused\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Amazing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Amazed\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Exciting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Excited\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Disgusting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Disgusted\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Annoying\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Annoyed\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Disgusting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Disgusted\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Tiring\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Tired\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Disappointing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Disappointed\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "How to create a good first impression and how to enhance findability."}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you write a manual, you need to make sure you do it well to catch users' attention. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Generally, most users do not get to the point where they read the manual; and if they do so, writers want to assure manuals are catchy and make a good first impression when seen. These are some tips you should take into account when creating a manual: <br/> <li>Use a clear font</li> <li>Use effective and clear pictures</li> <li>Avoid big amounts of texts</li> <li>Include customer service line number</li> <li>Use color</li>  <li>Make sure the size fits the product</li>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "How to enhance findability?<br/> Sometimes, users get frustrated because they do not find what they want in the manual, it happens generally because the words they look for and the ones in the manual are not the same. Take into account the following tips to increase findability: <br/>  <li>Divide into sections</li> <li>Organize information hierarchically</li> <li>Make sure you include synonyms</li> <li>Include a glossary with technical terms</li>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "conceive"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to think or make an idea of something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You need to define the type of users selecting the right vocabulary and conceiving the final version of the product. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob08aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cover"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the shelter or first page of a book"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should include a cover if the manual has more than 4 pages."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob08aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "give a hand"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to help or assist"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I was wondering if you could give me a hand with some tips."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob08aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "guideline"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a set of general instructions or indications about something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What are the other general guidelines or components? "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob08aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "highlight"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to emphasize or focus the attention on something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: creators need to make a good first impression within the first pages of the manual, highlighting the qualities, using appropriate and clear fonts."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob08aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "wonder"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to ask oneself a question"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I was wondering if you could give me a hand with some tips."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob08aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look for a manual."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read the manual and see if it has all the characteristics of a good manual."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write about all the corrections you would do to make it better"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Show your ideas to a partner or your instructor"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I read a manual"}, {"type": "text", "content": "I check it has all the required characteristics."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about the changes I would make"}, {"type": "text", "content": "I present my ideas to a partner."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"template_override": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "enpe8n6le02ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Beth</span>: Hi, Tim! I hope you're okay. I was wondering if you could give me a hand with some tips.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tim</span>: Hi, Beth. Sure! What do you want to know?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Beth</span>: Well, I need to know how a user manual is done. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tim</span>: There are certain elements you need to consider before you start. If you want to make an interesting manual, first, you need to define the type of users selecting the right vocabulary and conceiving the final version of the product. If you don't want to make your users bored, you will need to write in clear terms what you want them to understand."}, {"time": "31000", "image": "enpe8n6le02ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "And of course; if you present a problem about the product, you will make your users feel satisfied by providing solutions or recommendations about it. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Beth</span>: What are the other general guidelines or components? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tim</span>: You should include a cover if the manual has more than 4 pages. You need to write a quick start guide, so users will know how to use the product easily and step by step. Do not forget the table of contents, and write clearly the instructions and functions in the body of the manual. Include clear pictures and diagrams if necessary. <br>"}, {"time": "63800", "image": "enpe8n6le02ob08re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Beth</span>: I feel most customers do not get to read the manuals. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tim</span>: Right. Most customers go straight to use the product. That's the reason why creators need to make a good first impression within the first pages of the manual, highlighting the qualities, using appropriate and clear fonts, including pictures, selecting the correct size of the manual. It is also important to select the words carefully, using synonyms and providing short explanations only if needed. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Beth</span>: That's pretty clear, I'll start working right away.<br>"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n6le02ob08re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "enpe8n6le02ob08re2aud01"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can explain how to create a good user manual."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can list the general guidelines to write a user manual."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can describe how to create a good first impression and how to enhance findability."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Have you read a user manual? What advantages and disadvantages have you found?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Why is it so common that users do not read manuals?"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "t